{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern interpretation of the old &quot;steady hand&quot;/wire buzzer game from the 60's in VR!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your hand steady whilst moving a ring along a wire! Dodge obstacles, be as quick as you can, and don't touch the wire too much or you'll explode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FUR\u014c is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>, and has many features planned!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features available in <strong>Early Access</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loads of levels</strong>, in a variety of bizarre environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>levels</strong> and <strong>challenges</strong> to unlock stars which can be spent on, well, more levels!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned feature additions:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer (Online)</strong>: Compete with other players to complete levels in the quickest time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor</strong>: Create levels and share them with others!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildcards</strong>: Think of these like a variety of &quot;weapon mods&quot;. Slow down time to traverse fast moving &quot;platforms&quot; easier, teleport from one part of the level to another, regenerate health, and more!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cheater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3476210/d68f1f29d047fa73dfa389341317f90de2ef68be.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner's Luck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3476210/1ccc19300fae61d40b19eda15261cb9fce767e8f.jpg"},{"name":"Bronze Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3476210/e01f3d99c95d5fae49ec3f35417d8e474a7f5a90.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3476210/b2f73d75db71e083854050231944fc3a173d6bd2.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3476210/cec85dadeb0c26189dd78647e3545f6343c9121e.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3476210?t=1747213180","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747213180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476210/2fcf40005466246e8deb0ff80eec0ba495cfb72f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747213180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476210/2fcf40005466246e8deb0ff80eec0ba495cfb72f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747213180","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern interpretation of the old &quot;steady hand&quot;/wire buzzer game from the 60's in VR!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your hand steady whilst moving a ring along a wire! Dodge obstacles, be as quick as you can, and don't touch the wire too much or you'll explode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FUR\u014c is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>, and has many features planned!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features available in <strong>Early Access</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loads of levels</strong>, in a variety of bizarre environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>levels</strong> and <strong>challenges</strong> to unlock stars which can be spent on, well, more levels!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned feature additions:</h2